# Every text file checks out with LF, on every platform. The repository already
# stores LF and .editorconfig declares it, but core.autocrlf on a Windows clone
# rewrites the working copy to CRLF. A test that compares a raw string literal
# against serializer output then fails for a reason that lives in the checkout
# instead of in the code, and the shell script the container runs stops being
# readable by a shell that rejects CR.
* text=auto eol=lf
